  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring the Kaukau design.\r\n\r\nDiscover relaxed coastal living in Long Bay with the Kaukau design by G.J. Gardner Homes. This spacious two-storey home is designed for modern family living, offering four bedrooms, three bathrooms and two living areas. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living space creates a welcoming hub for everyday life, while the hidden scullery adds extra practicality and storage. With generous living spaces and a thoughtful layout, there is room for everyone to enjoy their own space while still coming together as a family.\r\n\r\nSet in the sought-after Long Bay community on Auckland’s North Shore, you’ll enjoy a wonderful coastal lifestyle with beautiful beaches, scenic walking tracks and green open spaces nearby. Long Bay Regional Park is perfect for weekend adventures, while local shops, schools and amenities make everyday living convenient. Whether you’re enjoying a morning walk by the beach or relaxing at home, Long Bay offers a lifestyle that combines natural beauty with modern convenience.\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
